# 📘 Project Information

## 🧾 Project Title
Sales Data Analysis & Business Intelligence Dashboard

---

## 🎓 Context
This project was developed as part of a portfolio assignment during the Atomcamp Data Analytics program. It demonstrates practical skills in data analysis, visualization, and business insight generation.

---

## 🎯 Problem Statement
Businesses often struggle to interpret raw sales data effectively. The objective of this project is to transform raw transactional data into meaningful insights that support strategic decision-making.

---

## 🧠 Approach
1. Data Cleaning and Preparation
2. Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
3. KPI Definition and Calculation
4. Dashboard Development
5. Insight Generation and Recommendations

---

## 🛠️ Skills Demonstrated
- Data Cleaning & Transformation
- Data Visualization
- Business Analysis
- Dashboard Design
- Analytical Thinking

---

## 📊 Key Metrics Used
- Total Sales
- Total Profit
- Profit Margin
- Category-wise Performance
- Time-based Trends

---

## 📌 Outcome
The project successfully delivers:
- A structured and interactive dashboard
- Clear business insights
- Actionable recommendations for improving profitability

---

## 📎 Deliverables
- Cleaned dataset
- Analytical dashboard (Power BI)
- Documentation (README & Project Info)

---

## 🚀 Value of the Project
This project showcases the ability to:
- Work with real-world datasets
- Translate data into business insights
- Build dashboards for stakeholders
- Communicate findings effectively




